# The plural year noun that frames a decade ("os anyos 80"); the singular
# "anyo" names a single year and must not reach the decade slot.
# Source: Wiktionary, s.v. "anyo" (https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/anyo),
# Aragonese noun: "anyo m (plural anyos)", citing the Aragonario,
# diccionario castellano-aragones.
anyos
